  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Optimized GetWindowMedian to sort in-place, reducing memory pressure and GC overhead.\n\n- Added configurable BoundaryMode (Symmetric, Replicate, ZeroPad, Adaptive) applied to AllMedian; selected mode is recorded in CSV headers and displayed in Excel headers (default : Symmetric).\n\n- Extended APIs (SignatureMedian overloads, Csv / ExcelOrderTickets and services) to accept and propagate BoundaryMode with backward-compatible defaults.\n\n- Added BoundaryMode (Symmetric / Replicate / ZeroPad / Adaptive) to README, examples, and API (tickets and services), clarified kernelWidth wording, and aligned CSV / Excel header documentation and progress reporting.\n\n-  Added MessageBox on Excel interop failure (with option to open Microsoft Office download page) and a generic error dialog; no changes outside NET48.\n\n- Added `running-median` tag to NuGet package metadata for improved discoverability.",
